    {
      "label": "caption-01",
      "frame": 115,
      "text": "窓際族のスタンプ、\nよう出来てるけど、\n使いどころ難しくない？",
      "speaker": "やめ太郎",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-01-0115.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-02",
      "frame": 240,
      "text": "「ごめんやで」とか、\n使いやすそうですよ。",
      "speaker": "たこさん",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-02-0240.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-03",
      "frame": 377,
      "text": "ワイだけ使用頻度が高そうやな。\nでも、この「お前島流し！」は、\nいつ使うねん。",
      "speaker": "やめ太郎",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-03-0377.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-04",
      "frame": 504,
      "text": "よーたんからや！",
      "speaker": "やめ太郎",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-04-0504.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-05",
      "frame": 646,
      "text": "ちょうど来たわ。\nこういう冗談に使うんやな。",
      "speaker": "やめ太郎",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-05-0646.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-06",
      "frame": 730,
      "text": "辞令って書いて\nありますけど。",
      "speaker": "たこさん",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-06-0730.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-07",
      "frame": 788,
      "text": "辞令？",
      "speaker": "やめ太郎",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-07-0788.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-08",
      "frame": 888,
      "text": "ガチの島流しやないか！",
      "speaker": "やめ太郎",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-08-0888.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-09",
      "frame": 952,
      "text": "ワイ明日から廃村ゆめみ村に\n異動らしいわ…",
      "speaker": "やめ太郎",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-09-0952.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-10",
      "frame": 1049,
      "text": "明日から廃村（ハイソン）\nエンジニアですね。",
      "speaker": "たこさん",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-10-1049.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-11",
      "frame": 1133,
      "text": "Pythonエンジニア\nみたいに言うな！",
      "speaker": "やめ太郎",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-11-1133.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-12",
      "frame": 1245,
      "text": "どうも、\n無職やめ太郎です。",
      "speaker": "やめ太郎",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-12-1245.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-13",
      "frame": 1321,
      "text": "どうも、たこさんです。",
      "speaker": "たこさん",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-13-1321.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-14",
      "frame": 1469,
      "text": "今回は、こちらの動く\nLINEスタンプを、Codexで\nどう作ったのか解説します。",
      "speaker": "たこさん",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-14-1469.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-15",
      "frame": 1667,
      "text": "第一弾に続いて、\n第二弾も販売に向けて\n準備中です。",
      "speaker": "たこさん",
      "file": "remotion/out/shorts-audit/caption-15-1667.png"
    },
    {
      "label": "caption-16",
      "frame": 1826,
      "text": "今回は、その二つを作る中で\n分かったコツを紹介します。",
